summary: CA basic smoke — IPACTA (IPA-hosted, no Dogtag)
description: |
  Parity counterpart to dogtagpki/pki plans/ca-basic-smoke.fmf
  (GHA ca-basic-test.yml smoke subset).

  Backend: IPACTA via ipa-server-install --internal-ca (IPAthinCA).
  Same intent as Dogtag pkispawn smoke: CA up, list profiles/certs
  (via IPA/Dogtag-compatible API), teardown.

  See tests/tmt/ca-basic-smoke/README.md
discover:
    how: fmf
    test:
        - /tests/tmt/ca-basic-smoke
provision:
    how: local
prepare:
    how: shell
    script:
      - |
        command -v docker >/dev/null \
          || { echo "ERROR: docker required for ca-basic-smoke"; exit 1; }
execute:
    how: tmt
finish:
    how: shell
    script:
      - |
        docker rm -f ipa 2>/dev/null || true
        docker network rm example 2>/dev/null || true
tag:
    - ca
    - ipacta
    - idm-8254
    - tier1
link:
    - verifies: https://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/IDM-8254
    - relates: https://github.com/dogtagpki/pki/blob/master/.github/workflows/ca-basic-test.yml
